From add3b9e59dc65224b7f161b306cad78c3b8f801e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tangelo Dev <tangelo-dev@noreply.invalid>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:15:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Include the remaining used standard headers, httplib and microprofile too

The Windows build (MSYS2 clang64, newest packages) got past patch 0076 and
stopped in externals/httplib/httplib.h: std::current_exception with an
incomplete std::exception_ptr, as <exception> was never included. A wider
scan (more standard types, plus the libraries kept in this repository
under externals/) found httplib also missing <stdexcept>, <vector>,
<chrono> and <limits>, microprofileui.h missing <mutex>, and 70 more places
in 63 files of src/ (mostly <utility> for std::move / std::pair, and
<stdexcept>, <tuple>, <memory>, <functional>, <cstring>, <limits>,
<exception>, <sstream>). All are included now, outside any #if block.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FYz3krf43qKGY6aS2Z5snz
